{
  "comment": "HostSIL FOC live-telemetry demo: same setup as sil_foc_demo but with a 30 s duration so there is time to attach RTEStudio (--tcp 127.0.0.1:14608 --protocol ivp) or scripts/ivp_probe.py while the firmware streams. Run: host_sil scenarios/sil_foc_live.json --live",
